OL,3,AOnlyFans owner was paid over $700m
OL,4,Abefore his death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe late owner of streaming platform
OL,7,FOnlyFans was paid more than $700m
OL,8,F(#513m) in dividends before his death
OL,9,Ffrom cancer earlier this year.
OL,11,FFenix International Ltd, the British
OL,12,Fcompany that owns OnlyFans, made $714m
OL,13,Fin profit before tax last year, it said
OL,14,Fin its annual report. This is an
OL,15,Fincrease of 5% from 2024.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
